    <section class="closing">
      <div class="container closing-inner" data-reveal>
        <div><p class="eyebrow">BUILD THE NEXT SOLUTION</p><h2>讓第一線需求，成為下一個開發起點</h2><p>加入 8 月 22 日二部曲，與醫藥及科技夥伴一起探索可落地的智慧照護解方。</p></div>
        <a class="button button-light" href={registrationLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">立即前往報名 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="organizers" aria-labelledby="organizers-title">
